FFmpeg
---------------------------------------------------------------------------

Optional native decoding / packaging may use prebuilt FFmpeg shared libraries
fetched via scripts/fetch-ffmpeg-linux.sh (for example from BtbN/FFmpeg-Builds).

Those builds may be GPL-licensed (e.g. *-gpl-shared). If you distribute a
binary that links against or bundles GPL FFmpeg libraries, that distribution
must comply with the applicable FFmpeg / GPL license terms.

Prefer system FFmpeg or LGPL builds when you need a non-GPL redistribution
story. FrameFlow source itself is MIT; bundling GPL libraries affects the
combined binary release, not the license of this repository's source tree.

